arbeitnow:site-reliability-engineer-plat.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What is the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform Infrastructure provides the infrastructure, tooling, processes and services that more than a thousand Elastic engineers depend on. We are about 110 people across ten teams in three groups: Core Infrastructure, Reliability Engineering, and Engineering Productivity &amp;amp; Developer Experience. We run the multi-cloud platform underneath Elastic Cloud Hosted and Serverless, the shared Kubernetes platform other Elastic teams build on, the observability estate that shows Cloud engineers what production is doing, and the release path the whole Elastic Stack ships through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an SRE here you take an engineering approach to reliability. You write the Go, Python and Terraform that replaces manual work, you carry the on-call rotation for what your team runs, and you work with Cloud engineering to close the gaps you find.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is expanding its Serverless offerring, and most of what we build sits underneath it. Current work includes packing hundreds of customer projects onto shared clusters, PrivateLink and static IPs, new regions, a single identity layer across the stack, and new government regions. We are also replacing manually managed services with code-managed systems, which lets the platform grow without the on-call load growing with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The scale is large. We run across multiple cloud providers and many regions, and some teams operate 200+ production deployments of our own product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are customer zero for Elastic Cloud Hosted, Serverless and the observability and security products, so new features land on our systems first and our feedback goes back to the product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The engineers who use what you build are a thousand colleagues you can go and talk to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-call follows the sun, which keeps the burden outside working hours small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are fully distributed across EMEA, NASA and APJ and the work happens in writing, so you control how you run your day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own systems end to end as the DRI on a project, and you break the work down yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the outcome of projects on your team’s roadmap as the DRI, breaking the work down and pulling in help when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and harden the infrastructure that other Elastic engineers depend on, managed as code with Terraform, Go and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build tools and services that remove manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry the on-call rotation for what your team runs, drive incidents to resolution and write RCAs that lead to lasting fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve observability, runbooks and documentation so the on-call load gets lighter over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code and designs, and act as a second set of eyes on production changes to critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise risks and ideas without being asked, and mentor engineers with less experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give feedback to the Elastic product teams on the features that reach our systems first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in SRE, platform engineering or infrastructure engineering, including real time operating what you built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Terraform at multi-workspace scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals in Go or Python, the languages most of what we build is written in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience carrying on-call, resolving incidents under pressure and writing RCAs that hold up under review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take an ambiguous project, come back with a plan and own it to the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You say when an estimate or a sequence is wrong before the team commits to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write clearly, because we work across nine time zones and the work happens in tickets and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay calm when something is broken, communicate while you work and write the follow-up that stops it happening again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity/affirmative action employer committed to diversity, equity, and inclusion. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: ----- style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes encryption software and technology that is subject to U.S. export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, the Crimea Region of Ukraine, the Donetsk People’s Republic (“DNR”), and the Luhansk People’s Republic (“LNR”). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:senior-mechanical-engineer-oxf.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Oxford Ionics, now part of IonQ, we are building the first practical quantum computer. Our systems are based on ion traps, which hold individual atomic ions tens of microns above the surface of a chip, and we design and build them in house, bringing together optomechanics, vacuum and cryogenic technology, electronics and system infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Mechanical Engineer to join our Systems team and take ownership of mechanical design from first requirements through to manufacture and integration. You will work on the hardware that surrounds the quantum processor, including cryostat requirements, cooling equipment, vacuum chambers and supporting structures, often in areas where the requirements are not yet fully defined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work alongside scientists, technicians and the wider hardware design teams to bring new systems through to manufacture. That means producing CAD designs, bills of materials and assembly drawings, managing documentation in our PLM system and working with suppliers and our manufacturing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our manufacturing team handles most assembly, but you will support technicians in the lab, investigate problems when they arise and make sure your designs can be built in practice. The work ranges from complex system layout to simple brackets and documentation, and you will see each piece through to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechanically integrate multiple sub systems into one complete system, driving the overall mechanical layout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce 3D designs of system assemblies and infrastructure, with detailed 2D drawings and bills of materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design systems for vacuum pump down, gas handling and coolant management lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the routing of cables, optical fibre and other physical services throughout the system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and scope requirements with scientists and engineers, then roll out upgrades and variations to system builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a mechanical engineer with a strong design background and a practical understanding of how things are assembled and manufactured. A degree in Mechanical Engineering or a related field, or equivalent experience, and around five years of relevant industry experience will give you the grounding the role needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want someone proactive who asks questions, gathers requirements, spots the missing details and sees a job through. You will be comfortable working independently with a high degree of autonomy, while collaborating closely with scientists and engineers across disciplines. Quantum experience is not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established CAD ability, ideally in SolidWorks, with a focus on assembly structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of complex multidisciplinary systems and good assembly practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cryogenic or vacuum systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GD&amp;amp;T and preparing drawings for manufacture and inspection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of PLM systems or thermal analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:account-executive-london-19949.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: &lt;/strong&gt;Account Executive&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;We Are&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RTB House is a next-generation performance demand-side platform (DSP) that uses proprietary Deep Learning AI algorithms to help brands grow. The company is the market leader in driving performance using Deep Learning across the entire purchase funnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012 and now operating in 90+ markets, RTB House has always been private-by-design. It embraces first-party advertising and a relentless approach to innovation. RTB House offers end-to-end Deep Learning-powered AdTech products and solutions to maximize conversion, drive new customer acquisition, create engagement, and fuel long-term demand for a global base of clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2026, RTB House launched rtb.com, a self-service platform specifically designed to allow small and medium-sized businesses and agencies to deploy auto-built creatives and maximize performance on any budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our dynamic UK team&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;consists of 40 people and is an integral part of our company’s global presence. We combine local expertise with our broader company vision and our sales team is the driving force behind our rapid expansion. You&#39;ll be at the forefront, forging partnerships that redefine how leading retailers engage their customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Why RTB House?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;If you are looking for a place where you can&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;unleash your potential and thrive in a dynamic, rapidly expanding global company with exceptional career advancement opportunities and the chance to shape our future, then RTB House might be the right fit for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;You Will&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute a sales strategy targeting assigned Enterprise and Mid-Market accounts, focusing exclusively on acquiring net new business opportunities in the UKI market primarily through outbound sales efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage outbound sales techniques as a primary focus, including cold calling, email outreach, and personalised messaging, to engage high-value prospects effectively and build strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage new sales opportunities to drive business growth within assigned accounts using a highly proactive and persistent approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal teams, Marketing, and ABM teams, to align on outbound strategies and maximise campaign effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as RTB House ambassador at key industry conferences, events, and networking opportunities, enhancing brand visibility and building a robust personal network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver engaging, data-driven, and persuasive sales presentations demonstrating our solutions’ value to decision-makers and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and nurture long-term relationships with Enterprise and Mid-Market clients, acting as a trusted advisor to address their business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a high level of customer relationship management, satisfaction, and post-sale interaction, partnering closely with Account Management and Technical Account Management teams to deliver exceptional client onboarding and ongoing support experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Head of Sales and peers to align on pipeline growth strategies, forecast sales outcomes, and report on sales performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving sales processes while providing feedback on tools, campaigns, and methodologies to achieve optimal team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Desired Experience&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 4 years of sales experience successfully selling to digital-native clients in the UKI market, with a proven track record in outbound sales as the primary driver of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional cold calling and outreach skills, with the ability to engage prospects, build trust, and convert leads into opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in using outbound sales tools and platforms to drive engagement and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to clients in retail, travel, and classifieds verticals is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to create tailored, value-driven proposals for Enterprise and Mid-Market clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and negotiation skills, with a proven ability to engage stakeholders at all levels of an organisation, including C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with performance marketing, programmatic buying, and RTB models is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the UKI digital media ecosystem, including industry-specific trends and challenges, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high sense of urgency, ownership, and accountability in meeting and exceeding sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;University degree or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;We Offer&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym Allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous external training budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work equipment of choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attractive parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“Work from anywhere” allowance policy in addition to a hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box to apply. If you are passionate about digital marketing, send us your CV, and we&#39;ll review it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datocms-assets.com/64097/1699016700-uk-information-for-applicants.pdf&quot;&gt;Information for Applicants: UK&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:principal-account-executive-pu.description:
&lt;p&gt;At Qualtrics, we create software that the world’s best brands use to deliver exceptional frontline experiences, build high-performing teams, and design products people love. But we are more than a platform. We are the creators and stewards of the Experience Management category serving over 18,000 clients globally. Building a category takes grit, determination, and an appreciation for the unconventional—but most of all it requires close-knit, high-functioning teams with an unwavering dedication to serving our customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When you join one of our teams, you’ll be part of a nimble group that’s empowered to set ambitious goals and move fast to achieve them. Strategic risks are encouraged, and complex problems are solved by collaborating and iterating until the best solution comes to light. You won’t have to look to find growth opportunities— they’ll find you. From retail to government to healthcare, we’re on a mission to bring humanity, connection, and empathy back to business. Join over 5,000 people across the globe who think that’s work worth doing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Principal Account Executive — ANZ Public Sector&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Principal Account Executive to lead growth across public sector and public utilities clients in ANZ from our Sydney hub. You’ll own complex, high-value opportunities that transform customer and employee experience through our SaaS XM platform, working directly with senior decision-makers (HR, marketing, executive leaders) and partnering with solutions consultants, services, marketing and customer success to design and close strategic programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes initiative and works entrepreneurially to navigate long, multi-stakeholder sales cycles and complex procurement processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trusted senior relationships—influencing executives in HR, marketing and broader leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent quota achiever with a proven ability to develop pipeline, forecast accurately and close large deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at selling SaaS/business transformation software into public or commercial clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persuasive, tailored communicator: aligns value messaging to client goals and procurement requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative cross-functional partner who leverages product, services and marketing to create winning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable to changing policy, market and client priorities in the public sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop as a strategic partner to government and utility leaders, influencing long-term transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deepen expertise in enterprise SaaS for experience management and business transformation across public sector use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand skills in negotiating large, complex deals and managing procurement &amp;amp; tender processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain visibility and influence across ANZ sales strategy and the broader product roadmap through customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue and pipeline growth across ANZ public sector and utilities: prospect, qualify and close target accounts to meet and exceed revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strategic account plans, power maps and tailored opportunity strategies, then execute demand-generation and stakeholder engagement to convert opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and nurture stakeholders from champions to C-level, align on value and procurement timelines, and lock in long-term program outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate public procurement and deal execution. Lead tender/RFP responses where applicable and partner with legal, finance and sales ops to remove blockers and ensure compliant contracting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead tailored product demonstrations and craft commercial proposals with solutions consultants to maximise customer ROI and win probability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate a smooth transition to customer success and services teams, track adoption and outcomes, and drive renewal and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of SaaS or software sales with a strong track record of meeting/exceeding quota—experience selling enterprise or transformation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success selling into public sector, utilities or similarly complex, procurement-driven markets is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging senior decision-makers in HR, marketing, executive or program leadership functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage long, complex sales cycles, produce reliable forecasts and build a qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation, presentation and consultative discovery skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using Salesforce.com (or similar CRMs) and working with cross-functional sales enablement resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant tertiary qualifications and familiarity with government procurement/tender processes are advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a high-performing ANZ public sector sales team focused on driving transformation through experience management technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role is consultative and strategic—ideal for sellers who enjoy complex deals, long-term programs and executive engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration is central: you’ll work closely with solutions consulting, services, marketing, legal and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team invests in development and promotes on performance—expect coaching, stretch targets and visible career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working here gives exposure to meaningful public-sector outcomes that impact large populations and communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team’s Favourite Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary + uncapped commissions and accelerators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-based promotions—advancement driven by results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health insurance with comprehensive medical and extras coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience Leave — 5 additional days per year for experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working (typically 3 days in office / 2 from home) and commuter allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunches and a well-stocked kitchen at our North Sydney office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualtrics Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt;: Our hybrid work model is elegantly simple: we all gather in the office three days a week; Mondays and Thursdays, plus one day selected by your organisational leader. These purposeful in-person days in thoughtfully designed offices help us do our best work and harness the power of collaboration and innovation. For the rest of the week, work where you want, owning the integration of work and life. #hybrid&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is an equal opportunity employer meaning that all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, status as a protected veteran, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;​​​​​​​Applicants in the United States of America have rights under Federal Employment Laws:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/fmla&quot;&gt;Family &amp;amp; Medical Leave Act&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/poster&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity Employment&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/employee-polygraph-protection-act&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is committed to the inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, Qualtrics will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided with reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please let your Qualtrics contact/recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
