&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:principal-solution-engineer-pa.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Strength in Trust&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OneTrust’s mission is to enable innovation through the responsible use of data and AI. We believe that ensuring data is trusted shouldn’t slow teams down—it should accelerate what’s possible. This led us to develop the first technology platform for responsible data use in 2016. Today, with AI representing the latest and most impactful expansion of data yet, OneTrust is once again redefining what responsible innovation looks like. OneTrust, the AI‑Ready Governance Platform™, unifies regulatory intelligence, automation, and connected governance workflows so businesses can continue to move at the speed of AI while ensuring good governance to prevent data misuse at scale. Trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide, OneTrust is shaping the future where trusted data becomes a transformative force for business and society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0d _1ibi0s3e heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;The Challenge&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Principal Solutions Engineer to shape and lead technical strategy for OneTrust’s most strategic and complex opportunities in France. Reporting to the Director of Solutions Engineering, you will bring broad portfolio fluency, deep enterprise technology expertise, executive-level customer engagement, and commercial judgement to help customers solve business-critical challenges with OneTrust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product, Engineering and partners to build deep account alignment, progress complex buying decisions, and create measurable customer and commercial outcomes. You will be a trusted advisor to senior customer stakeholders and a force multiplier for the Solutions Engineering organisation: setting s high bar, developing reusable approaches, and coaching others to raise the quality of our work. AI Governance is an important area of expertise for this role, alongside the breadth to lead opportunities across OneTrust’s entire platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0d _1ibi0s3e heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j08 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Lead technical strategy for complex, strategic sales opportunities, from discovery and solution design through executive presentations, RFPs, and proof-of-concept evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Advise customers on integration architecture, platform capabilities, implementation approaches, and technical best practices aligned to their objectives and environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Design and guide tailored demonstrations and proof-of-concept evaluations that clearly connect OneTrust’s capabilities to customer requirements and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales leaders to build opportunity strategy, navigate technical and competitive considerations, and communicate differentiated value to technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor in customer conversations, including architecture deep dives and discussions involving enterprise systems, APIs, cloud environments, and deployment patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Product, R&amp;amp;D, technical integrations, and partner teams to validate capabilities, influence product direction, and bring customer feedback into the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Share expertise across the Solutions Engineering organization by coaching peers, developing repeatable technical assets and approaches, and helping strengthen the team’s engagement practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Build and maintain a strong understanding of the privacy industry, regulatory environment, competitive landscape, and evolving customer needs; apply that knowledge to customer engagements and solution strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0d _1ibi0s3e heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;You Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;You are a credible, customer-focused technical leader who can move comfortably between business outcomes and detailed architecture. You bring sound judgment to ambiguous, fast-moving opportunities, communicate complex topics clearly, and influence stakeholders across customers and internal teams. You enjoy helping others succeed and can create leverage beyond your own account work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Experience Includes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j08 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Typically 8+ years of relevant experience, ideally in enterprise technology and/or cloud-based software, including significant customer-facing Solutions Engineering, consulting, or technical pre-sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;A track record of leading technical strategy for complex enterprise opportunities and communicating effectively with both executive and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Expertise delivering software demonstrations, technical evaluations, and proof-of-concept engagements, and translating customer requirements into solution designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Ability to build productive relationships across Sales, Product, R&amp;amp;D, Marketing, Engineering, and customer teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Strong communication, influencing, and problem-solving skills, with the entrepreneurial mindset to thrive in a complex and evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;A clear understanding of the privacy industry and its regulatory environment, or the ability to develop that expertise quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel as the role requires; an estimated 25% is assumed based on the reference description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0d _1ibi0s3e heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;Extra Awesome&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j08 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Experience working in AI Governance, Risk and/or Privacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0b&quot;&gt;Hands-on familiarity with REST APIs, JavaScript, FreeMarker, HTML, and CSS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Where we Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are embracing an office-first culture, encouraging three days a week in office for most roles, with meaningful opportunities to collaborate and celebrate in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each role may have specific requirements or flexibility depending on the scope of the position, so we encourage you to verify this with your recruiter during your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;As an employee at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTrust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;, you will be part of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTeam&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;. That means &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt; receive support physically, mentally, and emotionally so that you can do your best work both in and out of the office. This includes comprehensive healthcare coverage, flexible PTO, equity RSUs, annual performance bonus opportunities, retirement account support, 14+ weeks of paid parental leave, career development opportunities, company-paid privacy certification exam fees, and much more. Specific benefits differ by country. For more information, talk to your recruiter or visit onetrust.com/careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Resources&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out the following to learn more about OneTrust and its people:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq&quot; href=&quot;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTM-0khp0wIWkO-Bh3IfdSMMOi8606Tl0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;OneTrust Careers on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeatonetrust/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@LifeatOneTrust on Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Data&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have the right to have your personal data updated or removed. You also have the right to have a copy of the information OneTrust holds about you. Further details about these rights are available on the website in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://trustcenter-privacy.my.onetrust.com/policies/39803da3-9bb9-4709-afaf-2ba0a14d09ca?context=eyJkc1BvcnRhbElkIjoiZWM5MmYwZmEtYjFiNi00YzdlLWJmN2ItMDdlNTc2MTQyMGQxIn0%3D&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You can change your mind at any time and have your personal data removed from our database. In order to do this you must contact us and let us know you wish to be removed. The request should be made on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://privacyportal-cdn.onetrust.com/dsarwebform/37bcc497-a196-48f1-a08b-e897b5a77859/08a01c64-41fd-4b4e-9d42-cde44371a422.html&quot;&gt;Data Subject Request Form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Recruitment fraud warning:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;OneTrust is aware of scams involving false offers of employment with our company.&amp;nbsp;The fraudulent jobs, interviews and job offers use fake websites, email addresses, group chat and text messages. Be aware that we never ask candidates for personal information, IDs or bank information during the interview process. We do not interview prospective candidates via instant message or group chat, and do not require candidates to purchase products or services, or process payments on our behalf as a condition of any employment offer. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Please note that any legitimate interview availability requests will come directly from a OneTrust recruiter with an ----- email address. You may also receive legitimate emails from ----- Recruiters will only reach out to candidates who have applied for a role through our ATS (Greenhouse) or prospects via LinkedIn InMail. Job offers will come from a recruiter and may have a ----- email address. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;For more information or if you have been targeted please reach out to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join OneTrust you are stepping onto a launching pad — the countdown has begun. The destination? A career without boundaries working alongside a diverse and inclusive crew who is passionate about doing meaningful work. As a pioneer, your voice and expertise will help chart the direction of an entirely new category. Our commitment to putting people first starts with you. Your growth is part of the mission. Our goal is to give you the power to embark on the next phase of your uniquely, unique career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OneTrust provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:analytics-future-leaders-gradu.description:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership. Real impact. Build from day one.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an ambitious graduate ready to tackle complex&lt;strong&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; real-world challenges at the intersection of data, strategy and tech?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Future Leaders Graduate Program – Business Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; at Picnic is a two-year launchpad for exceptional talents. From day one, you join a business team, own a business topic, and become an expert in your field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we’re building the future of grocery. Using cutting-edge technology and data-driven innovation, we challenge the status quo and build the world’s smartest, most customer-focused supermarket. &lt;br&gt;We move fast, think big, and turn bold ideas into tangible impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with ambition&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring your relentless determination, creativity, and grit. Take the driver’s seat and redefine the grocery shopping experience for millions. You will be expected to think independently, move fast, and deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steep learning curve&lt;/strong&gt;: Your growth comes from owning real problems, testing your ideas, learning from your mistakes and starting again. You&#39;ll blend hands-on training with immediate execution, you’ll move at a pace that accelerates your growth like nowhere else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve real-life puzzles&lt;/strong&gt;: Spot opportunities, use tools at the forefront of technology, and own the outcome end to end. Not just making slides, but building the solution yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate across borders&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll collaborate with teams across the Netherlands, Germany, and France, tackling challenges that redefine how Picnic operates at a European scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-performance environment&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll work alongside some of the best teams in analytics and tech, people who set a high bar and expect you to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From learning to leading&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughout the two-year program, you’ll own business-critical projects from start to finish, supported by mentorship, learning sessions, and regular feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll strengthen your leadership skills in project management, storytelling, stakeholder communication, and giving and receiving feedback, while sharpening your technical skills in Python, SQL, Excel, and PowerPoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As your scope grows, so does your responsibility. You might scale your initial project or take on new challenges within the same domain. Either way, the pace is yours to set, and there’s always a new challenge to lead and an opportunity to make an impact. That’s why every journey is unique: there’s no standardized path through the program, just continuous opportunities to learn, and lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you’ll make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From day one, you’ll be embedded in a business team, taking ownership in one of the following domains:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer&lt;/strong&gt; - Drive growth through pricing, supplier strategy, and our market strategy. Think: Shaping our successful market entry into new cities. Your decisions shape how millions of customers experience Picnic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics &lt;/strong&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Build the backbone of Picnic: robotic fulfilment, demand forecasting, route optimization across Europe and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t wait for permission. You see a problem, build the solution, and bring people with you, before anyone asks. You&#39;ve probably already started something: a project, a product, a business, an initiative that didn&#39;t exist until you made it happen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More specifically, you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are about to graduate (or recently graduated) a Masters in a &lt;strong&gt;quantitative field&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in &lt;strong&gt;high-performance environments:&lt;/strong&gt; consulting, fast-growth startups, or competitive internships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show an &lt;strong&gt;entrepreneurial mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: you build, improve, and take ownership without being asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a builder&lt;/strong&gt;: hands-on, curious, and driven to challenge the status quo with practical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have already gained basic knowledge in &lt;strong&gt;PowerPoint, Python, SQL, Excel&lt;/strong&gt; or alternative coding languages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt; or valid &lt;strong&gt;EU working permit required&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Many strong candidates (particularly women) talk themselves out of applying because they don&#39;t tick every box. If this excites you and you believe you have what it takes, apply. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;We only hire when we find the right match. That’s why our selection process is intentionally highly selective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Picnic?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow as we grow&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re scaling quickly across countries and millions of customers and this is just the start. Grow your impact as we grow; we invest in your path but the driver&#39;s seat is always yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with other innovators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work with a driven, energetic team that builds, wins, and celebrates together (think of legendary Friday drinks, our Ski trip and our parties)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Earn a competitive salary and step into a program designed to launch your long-term future at Picnic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;When are you joining?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fall Edition 2026&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Start dates: September, October&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;*earlier or later dates can be arranged, please indicate your preference in the application question&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spring Edition 2027&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Start dates: February, March&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;*earlier or later dates can be arranged, please indicate your preference in the application question&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 Location: Full-time in Paris, with period trips to NL and DE&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;There is no &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;deadline&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Our aim is to find the most ambitious people out there. We onboard talents on a monthly basis, so whether you join in April or August, you’ll always have a group of people sharing the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲Health and Transportation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Through our partnerships with Malakoff Humanis and OpenUp, you have the opportunity to enroll in our company health insurance plan, as well as free and easy access to professional psychologists, workshops, and practical tools. Additionally, if you commute to work using public transportation, we reimburse 50% of your subscription cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍉Food&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Since we are located in the center of Paris, there is no on-site cafeteria. However, you will receive meal vouchers worth €11 per day to explore all the delicious restaurants nearby. Our small kitchen is also stocked with tasty snacks and refreshments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📈Personal and Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will have the opportunity to develop your skills not only through exciting projects and a dynamic environment but also via training programs offered by Lepaya.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏖️All the rest&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You get 25 days of paid vacation, plus additional rest days (RTT) based on the number of days worked in the year. Picnic provides you with a laptop, a phone, and a paid SIM card.&lt;br&gt;🚀Access to exclusive deals and perks through our Works Council (CSE) and our partner Swile (gift cards, concert tickets, cinema discounts, and more)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FAQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do I need a quantitative background? &lt;/strong&gt;It&#39;s a strong advantage, but not a hard requirement. If your internships and projects demonstrate real hands-on ownership and data-driven thinking, we&#39;ll consider your application. You do need a Master&#39;s degree, basic knowledge of Python or SQL, and relevant work experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Does the program include rotations?&lt;/strong&gt; No, intentionally. We believe depth creates ownership, and ownership creates impact. Rather than rotating across teams, you’ll go deep in one area, build real expertise, and gradually expand your scope as your impact grows. If you have topic preferences, tell us during the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In what language should I apply?&lt;/strong&gt; English. Please include your CV and Master&#39;s degree transcript or any other relevant test scores (e.g., GMAT)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the long-term opportunities after the program? &lt;/strong&gt;This program is a fast track into a high-impact career at Picnic, it’s an entry point for a long-term future, not a two-year stopover.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career paths here are as varied as the people on them. Some grow vertically, building deep expertise and a team around them as their project expands. Others move laterally - from Commercial to Fulfilment, Distribution to Customer, or wherever their strengths and ambitions take them. What they share is real ownership, real impact, and a career they shaped themselves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/yEQXLpeYN84?si=It-z9-XNLVMDeHEy&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:senior-country-commercial-mana.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is the leading business financial platform founded in the UK, empowering over 1 million small businesses to grow and succeed. Now expanding in France, Tide offers innovative financial tools and services to micro-entrepreneurs, freelancers, independent professionals (professions libérales) and small and medium-sized businesses (TPE/PME). Our mission is to save business owners time and money, enabling them to focus on what they do best - running their business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining a dedicated and dynamic team in Paris focused on driving Tide’s market success in France. The Tide France team is in an exciting growth phase, bringing together professionals with deep expertise in fintech, product development and French market dynamics. As part of this expanding team, you’ll have the unique opportunity to shape Tide’s presence in France, working collaboratively to deliver innovative solutions for French small business owners. This is your chance to play a pivotal role in establishing the foundation for our long-term success in this key market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Country Commercial Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, based in Paris, to drive the growth of Tide’s business accounts and payment solutions in France. In this pivotal role, you will lead product growth initiatives, leveraging analytics, customer insights, and market trends to position Tide as a leading financial partner for small businesses in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Country Commercial Manager, you will have accountability for French revenues, working closely with our Product, Engineering, and Marketing teams. Reporting directly to the Country Managing Director France, your expertise in the French market, SME customer behaviour and regulatory landscape (ACPR, PSD2, the e-invoicing reform) will be instrumental in shaping Tide’s offering and driving strategic growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some of the things you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Take ownership for driving revenue growth across product lines in France. Develop and execute strategies to meet revenue targets, working closely with cross-functional teams to ensure alignment between product offerings, pricing, and go-to-market initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local Market Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with the product research teams to conduct French market research to uncover customer needs, analyse a competitive landscape of neobanks and traditional banks, and identify market opportunities, such as the e-invoicing mandate (facturation électronique) rolling out from September 2026. Translate these insights into actionable strategies to enhance Tide’s product offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Localization and Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with global product managers to design and launch products tailored to the French market, reflecting local payment habits, invoicing and accounting workflows. Lead initiatives to ensure local relevance and compliance with French and EU requirements, while maintaining alignment with Tide’s global vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing and Sales Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with regional marketing teams to&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;develop and refine marketing and sales strategies for marketing the products in the French market, including partnerships with key SME channels such as accountants (experts-comptables) and the entrepreneur ecosystem (Bpifrance, CCI, incubators). Monitor performance metrics and adapt plans to ensure we meet and exceed growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content and Collateral Creation: &lt;/strong&gt;Support creation of high-quality marketing and customer-facing materials in French, ensuring they comply with French regulations (including ACPR rules on commercial practices) and resonate with local audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Readiness and Go-Live Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with the Operations team to ensure seamless product launches, from final QA testing to internal training and ongoing support for new features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Act as the central point of contact between Tide’s global teams and the Paris team, driving alignment and ensuring projects are delivered efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years&#39; relevant experience ideally within the SME, SaaS, or fintech industries in France. Experience with banking or payment solutions for French SMEs is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in French (native or near-native) and professional English, as you’ll work daily with French customers and partners and with Tide’s global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know the French SME ecosystem well (micro-entrepreneurs, TPE/PME, accountants, banking and payment players) and its regulatory environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at developing and executing commercial strategies that deliver measurable business impact. You’re not afraid to roll up your sleeves and remove blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have very strong project management skills and can foster collaboration with teams outside of your direct control by building strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re well versed in product analytics, and can use data to drive decisions within product marketing campaigns and follow it up with actions to constantly improve on product acquisition and engagement&amp;nbsp; goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked across multiple markets, navigating the complexities of global product development with a keen understanding of localization requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working in a fast-moving company where priorities can change and processes may need to be created from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a self-starter who doesn’t wait for instruction, and who works backwards from targets to ensure effective execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid leave per year (congés payés)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional 3 days of paid leave for volunteering or L&amp;amp;D&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We invest in your development with a professional L&amp;amp;D budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complementary health insurance (mutuelle) and disability and life cover (prévoyance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statutory pension contributions (basic and Agirc-Arrco complementary pension)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport pass (e.g. Navigo)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support through Plumm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A one-off home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work and travel globally - up to 90 days per country outside of your home country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team socials&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tidean Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices, including our Paris office, are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:head-of-communications-emea-37.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a leadership role spearheading Nebius’s communications across Europe and the Middle East: you will develop strong regional narratives, provide senior counsel, manage and develop the team, and lead consequential communications and stakeholder situations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reporting to the global Head of Communications, you will translate business priorities into compelling stories and a practical regional strategy. You will connect local developments to the company narrative and adapt them to the audiences and circumstances of each market.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We need an outstanding storyteller with the gravitas, experience and judgment to personally lead high-stakes situations involving multiple stakeholders. You will know when to shape the narrative, handle a difficult relationship or lead a response yourself, and when to give colleagues the authority and support to deliver.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The region has clear priorities, strong narratives, credible stories and trusted stakeholder relationships. Important situations receive the right senior attention. Colleagues understand their responsibilities, exercise sound judgment and develop under your leadership. Global colleagues have early visibility of consequential regional developments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Shape regional narratives and strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop communications strategy and strong narratives for priority European and Middle Eastern markets, linked to business priorities and the wider company story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify compelling stories and the evidence behind them. Make clear choices about audiences, markets and investment; adapt narratives locally while keeping core facts consistent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise senior leaders on positioning, communications opportunities and reputation risks. Define measurable objectives and use evidence to improve the programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead communications and consequential stakeholder situations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with regional business leaders, partners and relevant business, technology, infrastructure and local media. Create a sustained pipeline of credible stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and deliver the narratives, writing, executive counsel and stakeholder engagement that need your senior experience. Delegate other work with clear briefs, authority and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regional communications for customer, partner, product and infrastructure developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with country managers and public affairs colleagues on communications and local engagement around physical infrastructure builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage people and regional resources&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set team priorities and responsibilities, coach colleagues, manage performance and support their development. Build the capability and confidence to make sound decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance workloads and recommend where additional skills or capacity are needed. Recruit and onboard approved hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct agencies and partners through clear briefs, budgets and performance reviews. Judge what to own personally, what to delegate and when to intervene; retain accountability for quality and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate across the business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with stakeholders across Nebius – GTM country leads, Marketing, Business Diplomacy, Product, Research, Technology, subject experts and other colleagues – to coordinate on issues including regional priorities, policy, local engagement and reputation management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with US, APAC and global communications leaders on announcements, issues and executive visibility. Maintain early visibility of consequential developments within appropriate confidentiality controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong record of senior communications leadership in Europe and the Middle East, with substantial in-house technology-company experience and the ability to operate credibly across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding storytelling and narrative-development skills: translating complex business and technology priorities into compelling, credible stories for different audiences and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated people-management experience: setting goals, coaching, managing performance and developing capable colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gravitas and senior experience to personally lead high-stakes, multi-stakeholder situations, advise business leaders and navigate competing interests with sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of judging when personal involvement is essential and when to delegate, alongside strong media relationships and experience directing agencies and regional resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding English writing, editing and spoken communication, with the curiosity and rigor to understand complex technology and build accurate narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Helpful experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI, cloud infrastructure, enterprise technology or another complex B2B sector; regional expansion, infrastructure investment or a publicly listed company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial Middle East communications work, relevant media relationships and additional regional language skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency experience is valuable alongside substantial in-house experience; an agency-only background does not meet the role’s requirements. Journalism experience can be beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies and Behavioural Traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Strong narrative judgment, senior presence, clear prioritisation and calm leadership. A capable people manager who develops others, gives direct feedback and delegates with purpose. Takes personal ownership where the stakes or complexity require senior experience, while keeping regional and global colleagues aligned. Comfortable with ambiguity, iteration, course-correction, experimentation and (occasionally) failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A senior communications leadership role shaping narratives and stakeholder relationships across Europe and the Middle East, working closely with business and global communications leaders and developing the regional team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:principal-software-engineer-fr.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a problem solver, able to think outside the box and eager to nurture others and learn from them, then this is your challenge!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;principal engineer working across the entire frontend stack&lt;/strong&gt;, from design-system primitives to product-level architecture, you will shape how developers build with Algolia and how customers experience our products.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Frontend Experiences team, we&#39;re on a mission to make it effortless for developers to &lt;strong&gt;build great search and discovery experiences on the front end&lt;/strong&gt;, with libraries, components and tooling that are fast, accessible, and a pleasure to use. Our work reaches customers and their end users directly, on the web and on mobile, so the quality bar is high and the feedback loop is short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Right now, that includes a cross-team, multi-quarter effort to &lt;strong&gt;evolve the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt; from a collection of product surfaces into one coherent environment: a new navigation and information architecture, a shared component foundation, and an interaction model that supports traditional configuration, conversational assistance and agentic workflows side by side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is looking for an experienced individual who is well versed in defining, building and operating scalable architectures, with proven strengths in cross-team collaboration, taking solutions all the way through delivery to adoption by other engineering teams and by customers. You will play a pivotal role in architecting and implementing systems that play a central role across all of Algolia&#39;s front-end products, including libraries that run in production on thousands of customer sites. You will also play a role in training/mentoring and leading team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE WILL CONSIST OF:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defining the multi-year technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for Algolia&#39;s front-end platform, and turning it into roadmaps and projects that several teams can execute;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playing an active role in the evolution of the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt;: shaping the experience architecture, the component strategy and the technical foundations for conversational and agentic UX, and partnering with engineering, product and design leadership to sequence delivery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving convergence on a shared component library&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing duplicated components and inconsistent patterns across product surfaces;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing and delivering solutions&lt;/strong&gt; that will scale with significant volumes, be highly available, performant and resilient, including on pages and apps we do not control;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, taking them all the way through delivery to adoption by engineering teams and customers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping API design, versioning and backward-compatibility strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for public libraries used by a large developer community;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embodying technical expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, that the team can refer to for advice or validation of a solution;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setting engineering standards and best practices&lt;/strong&gt; to be followed by engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of setting technical direction across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a &lt;strong&gt;thought leader/standard-bearer&lt;/strong&gt; for engineers, inside and outside the company (talks, open source, writing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience &lt;strong&gt;leading engineers on large, cross-cutting projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience &lt;strong&gt;designing full stack solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, interacting with microservice architectures, and strong grounding beyond the frontend (APIs, backend services, delivery infrastructure) to make sound end-to-end trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep frontend expertise&lt;/strong&gt; (TypeScript, modern web platform, React and other major frameworks, accessibility, bundle size and runtime performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;designing and maintaining public libraries, SDKs or design systems&lt;/strong&gt;, with a feel for API ergonomics and a track record of managing breaking changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;building complex, high traffic &amp;amp; multi products web applications&lt;/strong&gt; such as dashboards or admin consoles, and leading cross-team UI consolidation efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in &lt;strong&gt;conversational and agentic interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; (chat, streaming responses, tool-driven workflows) and in the architecture needed to support them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with search UX patterns and with generative AI and agentic experiences is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for candidates with experience at our current stage and beyond (over 10,000 customers, $50-200M ARR range, high growth, lots of change and building internal infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;uil-fw-normal uil-ff-hind uil-fsz-16 lg:uil-fsz-18 uil-lh-bigger uil-color-grey-700&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€135.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

