arbeitnow:sales-enablement-director-2013.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now is an amazing time to join Nozomi Networks as we build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We defend some of the world’s largest organizations and critical infrastructure in more than 68 countries and we’re just getting started. Our AI-powered cybersecurity platform secures operational technology (OT) and Internet of Things (IoT) infrastructures for enterprises and government entities across energy, manufacturing, transportation, resources, and critical infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are building a team of highly capable, autonomous people who are passionate about solving significant cybersecurity challenges, acting with integrity, staying close to customers, and working as one connected organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is a senior individual-contributor role reporting to the Head of Global Sales Enablement. The Director will be both a trusted field advisor and a hands-on operator, equally comfortable coaching a live opportunity, facilitating a methodology workshop, building a targeted discovery guide, improving onboarding, or reviewing enablement data with Revenue Operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• Coach and Enable Revenue Teams by providing strategic and tactical coaching to sellers, sales engineers, partners, and managers to reinforce consistent sales execution and accelerate field performance.&lt;br&gt;• Design and Deliver Role-Based Enablement Programs by developing and managing onboarding, certification, continuous learning, career development, and skills advancement programs that reduce time-to-productivity.&lt;br&gt;• Drive Sales Readiness and Execution Excellence by creating and maintaining playbooks, battlecards, messaging, talk tracks, and best practices that align teams to a common sales methodology and winning motions.&lt;br&gt;• Measure Performance and Continuous Improvement by tracking enablement adoption, proficiency, readiness, and business impact through leading indicators, sales performance metrics, and actionable insights that refine programs and resources.&lt;br&gt;• Leverage Technology, AI, and Enablement Platforms to optimize the use of AI-powered coaching, conversation intelligence, LMS, CRM, content management platforms, and a scalable source of truth for the revenue organization.&lt;br&gt;• Champion Change Management and Cross-Functional Alignment by driving adoption of new methodologies, processes, tools, messaging, and co-selling practices through stakeholder influence and organizational alignment.&lt;br&gt;• Support Product and Go-to-Market Enablement by partnering with Product, Marketing, and Revenue leadership to prepare the field for launches, competitive differentiation, and evolving market opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;To be successful in this opportunity, you will have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• 8–10 years of demonstrated experience enabling quota-carrying Enterprise and/or Commercial sales teams in a complex B2B technology environment.&lt;br&gt;• Demonstrated ability to measure program adoption, readiness, behavior change, and relevant business impact, with strong facilitation, coaching, written and executive communication.&lt;br&gt;• Experience designing and delivering onboarding, continuous learning, assessments, and/or certification programs.&lt;br&gt;• Meaningful experience supporting technical sellers, Sales Engineers, solutions consultants, or comparable presales audiences.&lt;br&gt;• Proven success coaching sellers using live calls, active opportunities, deal reviews, role plays, or other practice-based methods.&lt;br&gt;• Ability to create concise field assets, including playbooks, talk tracks, competitive guidance, discovery frameworks, objection-handling resources and experience operating modern enablement systems.&lt;br&gt;• Preferred experience in cybersecurity, OT/ICS security, IoT security, critical infrastructure, industrial technology, cloud security, or another technically complex enterprise software category&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are and what we stand for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nozomi Networks is the leader in OT and IoT Cybersecurity. We protect the world&#39;s critical infrastructure, industrial and government organizations from cyber threats by providing exceptional network visibility, threat detection and operational insight. We’re always innovating and we hire the best at what they do to ensure our customers always have access to fast product enhancements, exceptional engineering support and rapid deployment across continents.&amp;nbsp;If you like a challenge, and value integrity and customer success, we invite you to help Nozomi Networks build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging are part of our core beliefs, at Nozomi Networks. Diversity of thought, background and culture broadens our knowledge of the world and helps us learn, grow, and gain new perspectives. What makes us all different is what makes us powerful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our benefits are customized to the country you are based in, naturally we want to get the best out of our Nozomiers, so we provide the best benefits packages, such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unparalleled Flexible Time-Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Need to know information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful candidates will be subjected to background verification checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be cautious of unsolicited messages, fake email addresses, requests for money and unclear job descriptions. Report suspicious activity to authorities. Our open job opportunities and descriptions are posted on Nozomi Networks&#39; career page. If in any doubt please apply for opportunities on our careers website &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you would like to know more about our Privacy Policy, please click &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Any questions about how we process personal information, or if you would like help exercising your privacy rights please contact us using the email provided within the Privacy Policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:group-agency-director-london-2.description:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Captify, now part of Verve Group, is the leading Search Intelligence Platform for the open web and the largest independent holder of first-party search data outside of Google, connecting the real-time searches from over 2 billion devices globally. Its Search Intelligence technology powers omnichannel programmatic advertising and real-time insights for the world’s biggest brands, such as Disney, Unilever, eBay, Mercedes-Benz, Microsoft, Nestlé, GSK, Uber, Mars, P&amp;amp;G, Sony and Toyota—without reliance on third-party cookies. Captify brings brands more customers, publishers greater yield and consumers the most relevant digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are looking for an enthusiastic and passionate Sales Planner to work alongside the Sales team to create growth opportunities with new and existing clients. You will be responsible for identifying key marketing opportunities, delivering best in class audience insights and supporting the commercial teams with your client and vertical expertise. In this role you will play a crucial part in helping drive commercial success and growth for the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Group Agency Director, you will own Captify&#39;s relationship with Publicis Groupe and be accountable for growing revenue across the group. You will lead a team of agency-facing sellers, set the strategy for the patch, and make Captify a go-to partner for Publicis agencies and their clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior commercial role. It combines hands-on relationship building at leadership level with team management, forecasting and close work with our product, data and operations teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP of Sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London, hybrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct reports:&lt;/strong&gt; 3/4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver the annual revenue target for the Publicis Groupe patch, including new and repeat business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a clear account plan across Publicis agencies and networks, identifying where Captify can grow share of spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead pitches, proposals and upfront or partnership negotiations at agency and holding-group level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep an accurate pipeline and forecast, and report performance to the leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the senior point of contact for Publicis Groupe, building trusted relationships from trading and investment leads through to agency and client leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Captify&#39;s search intelligence as a strategic asset for planning, activation and insight, not only a media line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot opportunities to work directly with key Publicis clients alongside their agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the group&#39;s priorities, structure changes and trading arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop a team of agency-facing sellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear targets, run regular pipeline and performance reviews, and support the team on key deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working across Captify&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Client Success, Product, Insights and Trading to deliver campaigns that perform and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed agency and client needs back into product and commercial strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share wins, case studies and best practice with the wider commercial team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in agency-facing sales or partnerships in ad tech, data or digital media, with a strong track record of hitting and beating revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established senior relationships within Publicis Groupe (for example Publicis Media, Starcom, Zenith, Spark Foundry, Digitas or Epsilon) and a good understanding of how the group plans and trades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing a commercial team, ideally including people managers or senior sellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence negotiating at holding-group level, including partnership and investment deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid grasp of programmatic, audience data, measurement and the privacy-led changes shaping digital advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative, insight-led selling style, and the ability to turn data into a clear commercial story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong forecasting and pipeline discipline, plus comfort with CRM tools such as Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, resilience and a collaborative approach to working across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like in 12 months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue from Publicis Groupe is growing in line with or ahead of target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Captify is active across more Publicis agencies and clients, with a clear plan for the next year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A partnership or preferred-supplier agreement is in place or in active negotiation at group level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team is fully staffed, hitting its targets, and has clear development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline and forecasting are accurate and trusted by leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with our Bupa HealthCare Plan with easy access to medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our Aviva Corporate Pension Scheme, with Verve contributing 5% of your qualifying earnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our Personalised Benefits Platform, with a budget of £50/month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with 25 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For candidates, view our EU HR Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.captify.co.uk/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

arbeitnow:principal-ai-engineer-ai-tutor.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DataCamp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DataCamp&#39;s mission is to empower everyone with the data and AI skills essential for 21st-century success. By providing practical, engaging learning experiences, DataCamp equips learners and organizations of all sizes to harness the power of data and AI. As a trusted partner to over&lt;strong&gt; 17 million learners&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; 6,000+ companies&lt;/strong&gt;, including 80% of the Fortune 1000, DataCamp is leading the charge in addressing the critical data and AI skills shortage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research has consistently shown that one-on-one tutoring dramatically outperforms traditional classroom instruction—a finding known as Bloom&#39;s 2 Sigma Problem. Despite decades of awareness, no solution has successfully delivered personalized tutoring at scale. Until now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an AI tutoring system designed to emulate and eventually surpass the best human tutors. You will work on the core AI system that delivers real-time, adaptive learning experiences to learners. &lt;strong&gt;If you&#39;re excited about building the future of human learning, this role is for you.&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt; This role can be done remotely from anyone of the following; United States, United Kingdom, Belgium, Portugal OR UAE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DataCamp, we seek individuals who embody our core values of data-driven decision-making, action, transparency, ownership, and customer focus. You thrive in a fast-paced, high-performing environment and are driven by a passion for making a meaningful impact. You&#39;re adaptable, embracing change and ambiguity with enthusiasm. Your initiative and entrepreneurial spirit push you beyond just meeting targets—you aim to understand the &quot;why&quot; behind our goals and take ownership to drive the business forward. You’re a collaborative team player who values transparency and always seeks to improve and innovate. If this sounds like you, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and evolve the core AI tutoring system&lt;/strong&gt;, including prompt architectures, agentic workflows, and real-time adaptive behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run rigorous experimentation and evaluation&lt;/strong&gt;, developing custom metrics and frameworks to measure learning effectiveness and improve model reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and implement scalable, maintainable software&lt;/strong&gt;, integrating AI capabilities with platform systems, content pipelines, and user experience components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with educators, content creators, and product teams to translate pedagogical goals into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype and productionize novel model interactions&lt;/strong&gt;, leveraging emerging research and capabilities to advance the tutor’s intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure quality, safety, and observability&lt;/strong&gt; through monitoring, testing, guardrails, and iterative refinement of model behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share knowledge and elevate teammates&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to a culture of clarity, simplicity, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years building complex LLM-based systems, with strong prompt engineering intuition and experience designing agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design meaningful evaluation methods, including custom metrics and frameworks when off-the-shelf options fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals, architectural thinking, and fluency in Python; comfortable working with production infrastructure, cloud environments, and CI/CD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively follows AI research and emerging capabilities, applying new ideas creatively to real problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Pedagogy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong empathy for learners and content creators; able to translate pedagogical goals into system behavior and product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to reason holistically across AI behavior, content structure, platform features, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with learning science or a desire to develop expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Character &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drawn to difficult, ambiguous problems with no clear blueprint; persistent in exploring and refining solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for elegance and simplicity in system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly across mediums and enjoys mentoring and collaborating in small, high-ownership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Datacamp?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining DataCamp means becoming part of a dynamic, creative, and international start-up. Here are just a few of the reasons why you’ll love being on our team:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exciting challenges: Face new technical challenges daily, keeping your work engaging and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation: We offer a competitive salary with attractive benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility: Benefit from flexible working hours because the future is flexible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous learning: Access a yearly learning budget for conferences &amp;amp; training to support your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global retreats: Participate in international company retreats, fostering a global team spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment: Yearly refreshment of your IT Equipment budget for your home working setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing team: Collaborate with a truly exceptional team—seriously, we’re awesome!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

