&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;A career that’s the whole package!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Conga, we’ve built a community where our colleagues can thrive. Here you’ll find opportunities to innovate and support growth through individual and team development, all within an environment where every voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&lt;/strong&gt; lines up commercial operations so companies run as connected, smarter businesses. By unifying the people and processes that drive commerce, Conga aligns pricing, quoting, contracting, rebates, and communications so teams stay in sync and buyers keep moving forward. The result is trusted decisions, consistent buyer experiences, and profitable growth. More than 10,000 customers worldwide, including over 50% of the Fortune 100®, trust Conga when commercial complexity is high and global impact is on the line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;A quick snapshot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Conga Solution Consultant, you will help drive continued growth for an innovative, rapidly growing enterprise software company. You will help a variety of B2B companies improve their pricing and margins, including manufacturers, distributors, cargo and logistics providers. You will partner with Sales to understand each customers&#39; business and challenges, shape solutions to those challenges, and set both sides up for long-term success, in a market you will help shape and lead. There is significant room to grow at Conga and your advancement will reflect the impact you make to the Pre-Sales organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Why &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;it&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; a big deal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pre-Sales showcases Conga’s products to prospects, customers, partners, and the market in ways that improve their daily work, earn them a career “win,” and set Conga apart from competitors. No two days are alike: you will build expertise in a growing market, in enterprise applications like Conga’s, in the CRMs and ERPs they connect to, and in the APIs that link them. You will work with every team in the company, including marketing, product, sales, and development. As a trusted advisor to senior business and technical leaders, you will contribute to our sales growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
