&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ experience of working in a senior role in corporate communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in an advisory firm is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in managing project teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of media, social media, and stakeholder environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent ability to shape and deliver strategic advice to senior level clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
